hamonikr-chatbot (1.2.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Changed default color scheme from 'system' to 'light' in GSettings schema and application logic
  * Updated the application to ensure 'light' theme is applied when 'system' is selected
  * Enhanced OpenAI client initialization to use a dummy key if the actual key is not available
  * Improved robustness and error handling for API key and base URL settings in OpenAI providers
  *   * remove greeting message and update UI titles
  *   * enhance chat appearance settings and update default provider
  *   * remove obsolete build and configuration files
  *   * update OpenRouter provider and model settings

